1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,480
A hundred million dollar diamond heist got wrecked by a salami sandwich.

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:09,200
February two thousand three. A trash bag sits by a road near Brussels.

3
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:13,920
Inside: evidence from a robbery, and a half-eaten sandwich.

4
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,620
Okay, rewind. Whose sandwich, and what robbery?

5
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,980
Antwerp, Belgium, the diamond capital of the world.

6
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:26,780
Now, under its Diamond Centre sits a vault of safe-deposit boxes, locked drawers people rent.

7
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:32,540
Layer after layer of security. Nobody gets in— well, nobody's supposed to.

8
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:36,740
Then enter Leonardo Notarbartolo. He said he was a diamond dealer.

9
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:39,620
He rented an office there, so now he could come and go.

10
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,080
Tap like if you'd have bought that cover story too.

11
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:46,120
One weekend, his crew hits the vault and cracks box after box.

12
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:49,020
Estimates say about a hundred million dollars.

13
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:53,300
A thousand years of hundred-grand paychecks, gone in one weekend.

14
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:57,020
Then the last step: burn the trash, so nothing's left.

15
00:00:57,020 --> 00:01:00,500
Send this to the friend whose plans always die at the last step.

16
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,560
But nobody burned it. The bag got dumped, and police found it.

17
00:01:04,980 --> 00:01:08,240
Police say that sandwich actually carried Notarbartolo's DNA.

18
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:13,960
And bro wasn't done. Five days later, he walked back into the Diamond Centre and got arrested.

19
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:17,040
Follow if you collect dumb ways to blow genius plans.

20
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:20,780
In two thousand five, an Antwerp court convicted him as the planner.

21
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:23,100
He was sentenced to ten years in prison.

22
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:25,240
Three of his crew got five years each.

23
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:27,560
And most of the diamonds? Never found.

24
00:01:28,180 --> 00:01:31,140
So which was dumber, the sandwich or walking back in?

